      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "From Meadview’s road you can see Lake Mead to the west, just 3 miles away, and reach the lake’s parking area 11 miles north.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
